SY_TALK("a8JbxL3Hto8",[[521,["Public Program, United Nations Headquarters, New York, USA, 19900606"]],[529,["I bow to you all, for you are the seekers of truth."]],[537,["When we talk of trutht, we must understand at the very outset"]],[545,["that Truth is what it is. We cannot mould it with our human awareness,"]],[552,["we cannot organize it and we cannot change it at all."]],[558,["So, what is the truth?"]],[562,["The truth is that we are not this body,"]],[567,["this intellect, emotions, this ego, the conditionings,"]],[574,["but we are the Spirit."]],[578,["And the second truth is that there is a subtle All-pervading Divine Power"]],[587,["which is doing all the living work."]],[590,["For example, we see the flowers and we take them for granted."]],[597,["Mohamed Saab [unsure] has said that, “If you just watch your eyes,"]],[601,["you will be surprised what a camera it is."]],[607,["So, all living things we take for granted"]],[610,["and we do not inquire as to how these things are worked out"]],[615,["and how all these living processes are going on around."]],[621,["Now we have, supposing, come from the amoeba stage to this stage."]],[625,["How have we come?"]],[628,["We did not do anything and how is it we have become human beings"]],[633,["and why have we become human beings?"]],[638,["When I first saw the mandate of the United Nations,"]],[645,["when my husband was elected, I was very happy because what it was saying"]],[651,["was exactly what we have to do,"]],[655,["is to become collective in a way, to have collective benevolence."]],[662,["But outwardly and superficially, we cannot become collective."]],[669,["We have to become inwardly collective"]],[672,["and for that something has to happen to us."]],[677,["Because if we were so easily collective, we would have absolute knowledge"]],[685,["and there would not be any difference of opinion."]],[689,["Everybody would say the same thing because if it is Absolute truth,"]],[693,["it has to be absolute for everyone."]],[696,["On the contrary, everybody is saying they have the truth."]],[700,["It seems they are all absolutely juxtaposition with each other."]],[705,["So, what is the thing that we are missing?"]],[710,["Whether it is religion, philosophy, thinking or all the philosophies of the world,"]],[717,["I feel that in the United Nations one has to get self-realization."]],[725,["Unless and until you get Self-realization,"]],[727,["this collectivity, which is the nature of your Spirit, will not manifest."]],[734,["The Spirit is the collective being within us."]],[739,["When it manifests, you’ll be amazed at yourself"]],[743,["that you can feel, the centers,"]],[748,["the subtle centres of another person on your fingertips"]],[751,["and you can feel the subtle centres"]],[754,["of your being also on your fingertips."]],[757,["In Koran, it is very nicely described that at the time of resurrection, your hands will speak."]],[764,["So when you get your Realization,"]],[767,["you can feel on your fingertips all the subtle centres"]],[771,["about which he was talking to you about. It is to be understood later on."]],[776,["But the first thing is that you must ask for your enlightenment."]],[782,["It’s a myth when we say that you are enlightened,"]],[787,["you are born again, or we are this or we are that."]],[791,["Unless and until you become Spirit in the real sense of the word,"]],[795,["that it is an actualization of the experience,"]],[798,["we are not to believe into it because that kind of belief is just blind"]],[802,["and it’s not for our benevolence or for the benevolence of the whole world."]],[810,["So this breakthrough in the evolutionary process has to take place."]],[814,["But for that one has to remember that as we have not prayed"]],[818,["for our evolution so far, we cannot pay for it."]],[821,["First of all, all people who talk of payment,"]],[826,["you must know that there is something falsehood behind it,"]],[830,["because you cannot pay for it. Like"]],[832,["if you have to sow a seed, you don’t pay anything to the Mother Earth."]],[839,["You may pay for the hall, you may pay for the car,"]],[843,["but you can’t pay for your self-realization."]],[846,["This is the first thing to be understood very clearly."]],[850,["But I find in the Western countries,"]],[852,["it is difficult for people to understand this point."]],[855,["I was surprised that the BBC people, such a well-equipped and sensible,"]],[862,["they told Me very frankly that the Anglo-Saxon brain"]],[865,["cannot understand anything without money."]],[869,["I said, “Who has made this Anglo-Saxon brain, first of all?”"]],[874,["The second point is that you believe in Christ."]],[879,["How much money did you pay to Christ? How much money did you pay to Buddha?"]],[885,["How much money did you pay to Mahavira? Or to Nanaka?"]],[890,["Or to anyone like that? They worked so hard for you."]],[894,["What did you do for them? Nothing but to torture. And never listened to them."]],[901,["The truth is so important today for us"]],[905,["that all our problems are there only because we have not felt the truth."]],[914,["You are talking now about imbalances,"]],[916,["you are talking about the physical problems of drugs and also of AIDS"]],[921,["and all other such things. All these can be cured"]],[925,["and completely prevented if you become the Spirit, you will be amazed."]],[930,["Because when this Kundalini rises,"]],[932,["She touches that All-pervading Vital Power and you are blessed"]],[939,["with all your physical, mental, and emotional upliftment,"]],[943,["not only that but complete nourishment."]],[948,["Because this little point was left out, we are suffering."]],[957,["Ecological problems can be solved very easily"]],[961,["if you get into your balances."]],[963,["For example, we use machines. For anything, we go to extremes."]],[969,["We have no balance. Actually, the mental projection is a linear movement."]],[975,["But if it has no support with reality, it recoils back on you."]],[980,["Even science, science, of course we must say that"]],[984,["science has done a lot of harm in a way"]],[987,["because it has produced atomic bombs and all that."]],[990,["But the science also tells us, “This is wrong."]],[994,["We are going too far with it. We should stop”."]],[997,["But we don’t pay any heed to it. This is our own mistake"]],[1002,["that we have to understand that there is a kind of balance"]],[1007,["which is needed in our own lives, in our own temperament,"]],[1011,["in our own being. But supposing if you force yourself, you cannot do it."]],[1015,["If you tell yourself, “No, no, no, you must be balanced,"]],[1018,["you should have balance, you should have a balanced life”, you cannot."]],[1023,["Because at the human awareness, you cannot."]],[1028,["But once you become the Spirit, it automatically works out."]],[1033,["Now in this diagram, you’ll see there are three channels which are shown"]],[1040,["and also there are centres which are shown here which are seven in number."]],[1049,["Now the centres are something like this, I would say,"]],[1055,["and this is the left and right side of the two sympathetic nervous systems"]],[1059,["and in the centre is the parasympathetic nervous system."]],[1062,["Doctors call it an autonomous nervous system. But who is the \"Auto\"?"]],[1067,["And who controls the \"Auto\"? And how to reach the \"Auto\" is the problem."]],[1073,["Supposing you have a tree, very much grown."]],[1077,["You must know it has to have roots down there."]],[1081,["If it has not got those roots developed, it’s about to fall off."]],[1086,["So this is the knowledge of the roots and as scientists,"]],[1091,["you must have an open mind about it, absolutely an open mind."]],[1095,["Take it as a hypothesis and if it works,"]],[1098,["as honest people, you have to accept it."]],[1101,["For example, my husband always said, “You are a saint, I know."]],[1105,["You are an awliya”. He used to say that."]],[1107,["“But I can’t believe you can make anybody like you."]],[1110,["It’s a different thing, a different category”."]],[1113,["But these days these categories are born."]],[1115,["So many are seeking the truth. Never in the history of spirituality,"]],[1120,["you had so many people who are seeking the Truth."]],[1123,["They are misled, I know, and they are used and exploited, I agree,"]],[1128,["but they are seekers. So, I call it the blossom time."]],[1132,["This is a special time when this has to happen."]],[1135,["But people have to have a seriousness about it."]],[1139,["When in the society that I move – as you know,"]],[1141,["there’s another society also that I have - in which I find people talking like this,"]],[1147,["“This guru is very good, he’s expensive, but very good”."]],[1152,["And the one gave some bargains and another has lowered some price."]],[1157,["If you are going to judge your guru by how much money he takes"]],[1161,["or how much you can save, then it’s such money-oriented nonsense,"]],[1166,["it cannot be anything divine. Divine doesn’t understand money, never."]],[1172,["So, once you understand this simple point,"]],[1175,["you’ll be able to reach the truth very easily"]],[1177,["that if you have to seek the truth, it’s a living process within you"]],[1181,["which has to work it out."]],[1183,["And when it works out, then only you can feel that"]],[1189,["beautiful, surrounding All-pervading Power,"]],[1193,["about which all the religions have described."]],[1198,["Now, if you go even to the religions which have only talked"]],[1201,["of the formless God, or some who have talked of the Form,"]],[1204,["there is one common point, they have said: seek the eternal -"]],[1208,["all of them has said - seek the eternal and use the temporary"]],[1215,["with all understanding in its own limitations."]],[1220,["But you can’t do it, that’s the trouble."]],[1223,["We just can’t keep ourselves into those limitations."]],[1227,["If we take to drinking, we become drunkards."]],[1229,["If we take to work, we become work alcoholics. workaholic"]],[1233,["If we take to anything, we go to extremes."]],[1237,["Only thing that really gives us the complete balance is the Spirit."]],[1242,["Now, how? Because Spirit is like the light."]],[1246,["Supposing you are holding a snake in your hand and if somebody tells you"]],[1251,["\"You are holding a snake in your hand\", and it’s all darkness."]],[1256,["Then one may say, “No, it’s not. It’s a rope.” How can you argue?"]],[1261,["Till the snake bites the person, he is not going to leave the snake."]],[1265,["The best thing is to put on the light. In that light, he can see and can throw away the snake."]],[1272,["This is how today’s Sahaja Yoga is working."]],[1275,["\"Sahaja\" means \"born with you\","]],[1277,["is the right to be united with this Divine Power."]],[1282,["Yoga doesn’t mean standing on your heads."]],[1285,["It doesn’t mean breaking your knees. It doesn’t mean that at all."]],[1288,["If you see Patanjali Yoga, then in the Patanjali,"]],[1292,["he has written eight into eight ashtangas into eight folds,"]],[1298,["out of which Yama Niyama is a wee bit,"]],[1302,["out of which the exercises are even much, much a smaller percentage."]],[1309,["Also, it is said very clearly that when your Kundalini rises,"]],[1315,["then you must do this centre or this center is being augmented,"]],[1321,["constricted, then you have to use a particular type of an exercise."]],[1328,["Patanjali Yoga is such a big book."]],[1332,["But those people who just make it a physical one"]],[1336,["do not understand that we are not only physical being."]],[1340,["If we were only physical being, I get many wrestlers coming to me"]],[1343,["to say that, “Mother, we have no peace. Will you give us peace?”"]],[1349,["We are much more than physical beings. We are physical beings,"]],[1354,["we are mental beings,"]],[1357,["we are emotional beings. Above all, we are spiritual beings."]],[1362,["And that spiritual being has to manifest."]],[1366,["That manifestation has to take place in our awareness."]],[1370,["Then so many things happen to us."]],[1373,["First of all, as I told you, that with this connection,"]],[1376,["this vital energy starts flowing through you."]],[1379,["Now this energy has got so many qualities. First is it comforts you."]],[1386,["It comforts you, in the sense, it cures you, automatically."]],[1391,["It’s your own power that cures you. Of course, it is true."]],[1395,["Through Sahaja Yoga, people have been cured of blood cancer,"]],[1398,["of many serious diseases and, if you would allow me,"]],[1402,["I would say that AIDS has also been cured with Sahaja Yoga"]],[1407,["in Australia, no doubt."]],[1409,["But such complications that, in this country, you cannot cure anyone."]],[1413,["I mean, I don’t cure but even if your Kundalini cures,"]],[1416,["you may be arrested for that."]],[1419,["I mean, in all the Western countries this is a problem"]],[1422,["and in India, an AIDS patient cannot come."]],[1426,["All such complications are there. But these things are so easily cured,"]],[1432,["if you allow your Kundalini to rise and now doctors have accepted it."]],[1437,["I must say that Russians,"]],[1439,["whatever you may say about their radiums and all that."]],[1442,["Forget about it. I’m not interested in their politics."]],[1445,["But the people are so wise, so wise and so sensible."]],[1451,["Their doctors and Nobel Prize winners are so sensible, so serious-minded."]],[1456,["They have taken to Sahaja Yoga so seriously."]],[1458,["I’m amazed that what’s the use of our democracy"]],[1462,["that he had all over that we did not understand"]],[1465,["the importance of our ascent that we have to find something."]],[1469,["We are so satisfied with ourselves, whatever we have?"]],[1472,["We talk of ecological problems, this problem, that problem,"]],[1476,["but we don’t think how we can get out of it."]],[1480,["We never bothered to see what will help us."]],[1483,["People talk of spirituality here and there."]],[1485,["It’s a serious thing one has to understand."]],[1488,["If the United Nations has to express itself in reality,"]],[1495,["then I would say the people of United Nations"]],[1498,["must get their Self-realization first."]],[1500,["And then they can understand what they are, how great they are,"]],[1505,["how glorious they are."]],[1508,["So many ways and so many powers they have which they can use"]],[1512,["and this is the Power of Love which we have never used."]],[1515,["When you read about the United Nations, you think it was conceived"]],[1520,["as a thing which works on the Power of Love."]],[1524,["But where is that Power of Love? That is this All-Pervading Power."]],[1529,["You become extremely dynamic,"]],[1533,["extremely active, extremely sensible, wise,"]],[1539,["but above all, extremely compassionate."]],[1544,["And this is what has to happen to us. It is not lip service."]],[1548,["We cannot sit on the table and talk of peace."]],[1551,["I’ve known people who’ve got Nobel Prize in peace."]],[1556,["They are the hottest people you could ever think of, I tell you."]],[1559,["I don’t know how they got this prize, maybe for some sort of a"]],[1562,["thing they did on a very superficial level."]],[1566,["But the person who is not peaceful within himself, how can he spread peace?"]],[1572,["You have to have your own peace within yourself,"]],[1576,["you have to feel your peace within yourself,"]],[1578,["and then only you can do something about it."]],[1581,["A person who has achieved that, even the presence of such a person"]],[1585,["can emit that peace that we are talking about."]],[1590,["So I have to request you all as members of the United Nations,"]],[1595,["because my husband has been there for 16 years, as you know."]],[1599,["and he had to resign otherwise they would not allow him to get out."]],[1604,["I told him that unless and until you resign,"]],[1606,["I would not be able to talk like this to them."]],[1609,["But it’s a fact, I must tell you, as members of United Nations,"]],[1613,["all of you have to ask for your Self-realization,"]],[1616,["to understand yourself fully well"]],[1619,["and then you will see how dynamic you become."]],[1622,["All of your problems become immediately solved,"]],[1624,["because you become detached from your problems"]],[1627,["and you can see them better and you can solve them better. This knowledge is such a lot that I cannot cover the whole subject in one lecture. I must have given thousands of lectures only in the English language."]],[1630,["I mean, this knowledge is such a lot that I cannot cover"]],[1635,["the whole subject in one lecture. I must have given"]],[1637,["thousands of lectures only in the English language."]],[1641,["But I would say that like these lights are here"]],[1645,["and if I have to tell you about electricity, how it has come,"]],[1647,["how it was discovered and all that, it’s a headache."]],[1650,["It’s better I tell you that you put on the light."]],[1653,["It’s better that we have our light and see for ourselves in our light"]],[1658,["what our problem is. People get mad,"]],[1660,["they don’t know they are getting mad, people get cancer,"]],[1663,["they don’t know they are getting cancer, they are all the time"]],[1666,["under the fear, \"this might happen to me, that might happen to me.\""]],[1670,["But with Sahaja Yoga, immediately you will know what’s wrong with you"]],[1673,["and if you will know how to correct it, it hardly takes any time."]],[1677,["But the transition between the awakening of the Kundalini and the mastering,"]],[1682,["it is hardly one month’s time. But even that much patience,"]],[1685,["people don’t have, how are you going to work out?"]],[1689,["But it’s very amazing, just think of it, is very amazing"]],[1694,["that the eastern block people are so easily taking to it"]],[1700,["that russians are so easily taken to it,"]],[1703,["while we, who have the freedom to express ourselves,"]],[1708,["freedom to do what we like are not so good."]],[1713,["I must confess that I really was astounded"]],[1720,["the way these people reacted. What’s wrong with us?"]],[1724,["Why shouldn’t it happen to us here?"]],[1727,["I just cannot put my finger on to anything as such,"]],[1731,["while all kinds of falsehood we accept, all kinds of falsehood."]],[1736,["I mean, if somebody comes and says, “All right, you dance.”"]],[1738,["So we think we are spiritual, anything."]],[1743,["But nobody has been able to deliver the goods."]],[1747,["I always say, “If you have a guru, what have you got from your guru?”"]],[1751,["I am your Mother, say. I would like to know: what powers have you got?"]],[1755,["Now this gentleman who spoke to you today,"]],[1758,["do you know how many people he has given realization to?"]],[1763,["How many things he has done? There are many sitting here who have been doing all these things."]],[1768,["They look just like you, simple people,"]],[1770,["leading a very simple life, a very sane life, good people."]],[1776,["As my husband would say, “They are all angels.”"]],[1779,["But they have become angels. Some of them were drug addicts,"]],[1783,["some of them were very immoral, some of them were absolutely lost cases"]],[1789,["and see where they are. And why can’t we learn this art?"]],[1793,["It is simple, so easy. You don’t have to pay. It’s your own."]],[1798,["This is what sometimes I can’t understand"]],[1802,["and I would be very happy if you can ask me some questions about it."]],[1805,["But I really request you people, to take it up seriously and work it out."]],[1812,["When people will see how you’ve changed, how you have transformed,"]],[1815,["how you have become dynamic, they will definitely follow you."]],[1820,["You cannot force it on you. That’s the only problem"]],[1823,["is that your freedom is to be respected."]],[1827,["You cannot say that you have to take your Realization."]],[1831,["You have to understand yourself mentally and to ask for it."]],[1836,["Otherwise, it cannot be forced."]],[1838,["But I would like to have some questions from you."]],[1842,["Thank you, thank you very much."]],[1885,["[Question about Transcendental Meditation]"]],[1892,["It’s a very controversial subject, but if you want me to tell you the truth,"]],[1897,["I can tell you the truth without any fear."]],[1902,["I came to know about Transcendental Meditation when I was in London."]],[1910,["A gentleman contacted me saying that he would like to see me."]],[1915,["So I said, “Why?” He said, \"I am suffering from epilepsy,"]],[1919,["my wife is suffering from epilepsy, my daughter is suffering from epilepsy."]],[1925,["I said, “All right, come and I have you, I would like to see you, come.”"]],[1929,["So I gave him a time and he came down."]],[1932,["I was amazed when he told me that he was the head"]],[1938,["of the Flying Foundation of Transcendental Meditation."]],[1944,["And his deputy director had also come"]],[1948,["and when I asked him what is this Transcendental Meditation,"]],[1951,["I was amazed that the whole thing…"]],[1956,["He told me that \"we had to do three mantras\"."]],[1962,["for which they had to pay 300 pounds each."]],[1970,["I said, “What are those mantras?” First, he was hesitating."]],[1974,["I said, “You have to tell me the mantras otherwise"]],[1976,["I will not be able to say what it is, why you have caught epilepsy.”"]],[1981,["He said, “The first mantra was inga. The second was pinga and third was thinga.”"]],[1989,["If there is any Indian gentleman here he will know what it means."]],[1994,["Inga means the bite of a scorpion, is not a Sanskrit word."]],[2000,["Pinga means when a person gets possessed he goes round and round,"]],[2003,["that's pinga, and thinga means when you show like that a thumb."]],[2009,["For that, they paid 300 pounds"]],[2012,["and they were told not to talk about it to anyone."]],[2015,["Now, this is coming from the head of that foundation who was suffering from epilepsy."]],[2023,["This poor fellow he became ultimately bankrupt."]],[2026,["His wife was a granddaughter of a duke in England."]],[2031,["Of course, they were all cured, they are alright,"]],[2035,["but he had to go away to South Africa."]],[2037,["He was a diamond merchant and he lost everything as a bankrupt."]],[2044,["Then so many came from there and so many who had become just recluses."]],[2050,["They could not see the garlic or they could not see a lemon."]],[2056,["If you showed them the lemon, they used to tremble."]],[2060,["In the beginning, they said they felt very much elated."]],[2062,["Of course, about this, I will tell you later on about how our souls are"]],[2066,["and how our souls can be possessed."]],[2070,["You asked me directly so I have to tell you very directly, madame."]],[2074,["The second thing that they did was to start a siddha course,"]],[2077,["they called it, for which they charged 6,000 pounds"]],[2082,["and people had to go to Switzerland to stay in hotels"]],[2089,["and they were given some mats to jump,"]],[2091,["because they were supposed to fly in the air, so-called."]],[2096,["First of all, why do you want to fly in the air halfway like that?"]],[2100,["Imagine already there are such problems of traffics, because of that, I was delayed."]],[2109,["And so many people paid 6,000 pounds for that."]],[2113,["Now the food that was given – it’s authentic, absolutely –"]],[2118,["for six days, was the water that boiled potatoes."]],[2125,["Six says and the seventh day was [UNCLEAR]"]],[2128,["and the eighth day they were given the potatoes to eat."]],[2135,["And they were told that \"you have to do it if you have to fly in the air.\""]],[2139,["So many of them broke their bottoms"]],[2143,["and broke their bones, pelvic bones, is a fact."]],[2152,["And I think the guru must have felt what stupid people these are,"]],[2156,["so he used to giggle all the time, he was called as the giggling guru."]],[2160,["If people are that stupid, what can you do about it?"]],[2167,["And they don’t know. I said, “Why don’t you ask them,"]],[2170,["‘Why this mantra? Why? What is this? For what?”"]],[2173,["In Sahaja Yoga, you know each and everything."]],[2176,["Of course, after Realization, you have to know all about the mechanism,"]],[2180,["you have to know about what is the… say, for example,"]],[2183,["the Kundalini stops at this centre of the optic chiasma,"]],[2186,["then you have to say the Lord’s Prayer."]],[2190,["You have to say, “Allah hu Akbar” at this point. So many there are."]],[2194,["But it’s so scientific that you can see the movement of the Kundalini."]],[2203,["All kinds of stupid things people do."]],[2206,["Somebody says ‘shakti path’, somebody says that."]],[2209,["And pPeople become really mad after that."]],[2213,["First of all, what knowledge did you get? Put that question."]],[2217,["You must go and see the disciples, what knowledge there is?"]],[2224,["Nowadays, supposing somebody has started Ayurveda."]],[2227,["We don’t need any guru for that, you can go to Ayurveda"]],[2230,["any time. Is like just your medicine,"]],[2234,["you don’t need a guru to go to any doctor, do you?"]],[2239,["But we are so dumb and here I don’t know how people accept these things,"]],[2245,["still, I can’t understand."]],[2247,["There’s a lady who has laser beams, put like that, you see, from outside"]],[2251,["and for one meeting like this, she takes 3,000 pounds, 3,000 pounds,"]],[2259,["that to enrol. Can you believe it?"]],[2262,["Because you’ve asked me the question I have to tell you"]],[2265,["this is what is going on, Madam, and for Chinese especially,"]],[2269,["you be very careful. You are very vulnerable"]],[2271,["because now you have become very rich"]],[2274,["and they only cling on to rich people, so be very careful."]],[2277,["First of all, you must find out what are the disciples like,"]],[2281,["what are they doing and how they are doing."]],[2286,["I talked about it in 1970."]],[2290,["Openly I told their names and gave their names, what devils they are."]],[2295,["But nobody would listen to me. Even this Rajneesh, I told about him so many things."]],[2300,["And they are the ones stopping us coming to you and everywhere."]],[2304,["Do you know that? They are putting money to many newspapers"]],[2309,["that I should not be there in any way."]],[2314,["Even my advertisement should not be there."]],[2319,["But they are all very friendly because Satan"]],[2322,["doesn’t speak against his own house. Christ said it clearly."]],[2328,["They are all very friendly with each other."]],[2330,["But we have to know the truth and the truth is that"]],[2334,["you have to become the Spirit and you must get the powers of the Spirit."]],[2338,["If you do not have the powers of the Spirit, don’t listen to these big claims."]],[2343,["There is nothing to be claimed about. It is to be achieved, to be actualized."]],[2351,["I’m sorry I have to say all this, but one has to say,"]],[2355,["because she asked me a question about it."]],[2360,["Moreover, there is another problem."]],[2364,["The another problem is like this that if you pay money for something,"]],[2367,["say, we go to a theatre and we pay money for a ticket"]],[2373,["and then what we find that it's not very good, the play is not very good,"]],[2377,["but we say \"let’s have it, you see, we have paid for it\", we go through it."]],[2382,["So this commitment because of payment is even worse."]],[2386,["So you come out from there hurt and see people,"]],[2391,["their Kundalini just like, I cannot tell you how it looks,"]],[2397,["as if it’s been beaten up"]],[2401,["and trying to rise putting up Her head and again it falls down."]],[2407,["So weak she is and she is your Mother, your individual Mother."]],[2413,["And she feels so helpless that she cannot give you your Self-realization,"]],[2418,["She cannot give you your second birth,"]],[2422,["because you have stupidly followed something which was very wrong."]],[2426,["Even though, I must tell you, that Sahaja Yoga works out even such difficulties."]],[2433,["All kinds of things are going on. Let somebody bring some diamond"]],[2436,["or somebody shows some sort of ashes and things."]],[2440,["For a diamond, you can go to a shop here, you see?"]],[2446,["What has God to do, God, God to do with diamonds?"]],[2451,["You see, or any divinity have to do with diamonds?"]],[2455,["What do you care for diamonds?"]],[2459,["So this is a big, very big problem today, because we have choices, you see,"]],[2465,["we have choices of this and choices of that and choices of this."]],[2468,["But we have lost that discretion to find out what we should have."]],[2476,["And so many people are hurt."]],[2480,["I have been talking about it very openly."]],[2483,["Nobody has ever come forward before me and said this and this about Sahaja Yoga."]],[2490,["I have said all sorts of things about them, nobody has come forward so far."]],[2495,["Nobody has said a word about it,"]],[2498,["nor did they go to the courts or anywhere against me."]],[2502,["They could have done it very easily, but they could not."]],[2508,["And because you have asked me today, I’d better warn you. It’s true."]],[2520,["Yes, please."]],[2532,["[What is the role of prayer in Sahaja Yoga.]"]],[2536,["Role of what? [Of prayer, praying.] Prayer."]],[2539,["[and is the change permanent?]"]],[2543,["See now, if you are not connected with the divine,"]],[2547,["your prayers are like telephoning without the connection."]],[2552,["That’s why prayers don’t help. And people do come and say that,"]],[2557,["“We’ve been praying to God, we've praying, you see now, what is our condition”."]],[2561,["Which god are you praying to? First of all, you must have your connection."]],[2567,["Then even once you remember the name of God, it works,"]],[2574,["even once."]],[2577,["But you have to have the connection."]],[2582,["It has a very great role only if you are connected."]],[2594,["[Is the change permanent?]"]],[2599,["It is. Once you have to work it out also, that the Kundalini rises,"]],[2608,["pierces through your fontanelle bone area,"]],[2611,["gives your actualization of baptism nicely,"]],[2614,["you should feel the cool breeze coming out of your head,"]],[2617,["and you should feel on your hands from all over this cool breeze,"]],[2621,["but you have to establish this connection properly."]],[2625,["Sometimes the Kundalini attends to places where you have sickness,"]],[2629,["where you have mental problems. So you must learn."]],[2633,["That’s what I said that one month is needed, at the most, to fix it."]],[2637,["Once you are fixed, you are fixed. It’s permanent."]],[2656,["[Being a Christian, how can we practice Sahaja Yoga without feeling a conflict?]"]],[2662,["There is no conflict because this is real Christianity, what Christ has said."]],[2667,["You see, the Christianity that you practice is not Christ Christianity."]],[2671,["It’s the Christianity of Mr Paul and, later on, Mr Augustine"]],[2677,["who had nothing to do with Christ."]],[2682,["It’s all money-making propositions."]],[2687,["I know because I was born in a Christian family and I asked my father,"]],[2691,["I said, “Who is this Mr Paul in the Bible? I can't understand him.”"]],[2695,["He said, “Same here, he’s a stranger.” And if you read Kalil Gibran,"]],[2700,["he has given a big chapter on this gentleman, Mr Paul."]],[2704,["There’s no conflict at all."]],[2710,["What’s the use of… The other day you must have seen"]],[2713,["these fundamentalist, Christian fundamentalist jeering at Gorbachev,"]],[2719,["who is a great man, no doubt about it."]],[2722,["because they think they are very great for have they achieved,"]],[2725,["Christians, what have they achieved? Tell me."]],[2727,["You see, in India what I know about Christians is that they take a gun in one hand"]],[2731,["and a Bible in the other hand. That’s what they are. Let us face it."]],[2738,["What have they done? What good have they done the so-called Christians?"]],[2743,["Where we are sitting today in this America, what have they done?"]],[2748,["Where have the people gone who lived here, who owned this country?"]],[2754,["Thank God Columbus came to this side. Otherwise, our India,"]],[2757,["if he had reached, we would be not there anymore, finished."]],[2767,["Same about Hindus, same about Muslims"]],[2769,["and same about all the people. These are all man-made religions."]],[2774,["Religion is within ourselves and when it is awakened,"]],[2778,["you will really know how righteous you are."]],[2782,["Anybody, whether you are Christian, Hindu, Muslim, Sikh,"]],[2785,["any religion you may follow, you can commit any sin."]],[2789,["There is no bondage, no bondage."]],[2793,["You can tell lies, you can murder anyone."]],[2795,["You don’t stop because you are a Christian, you don’t stop because you are a Hindu,"]],[2798,["you don't stop anything. But Christ, Christ was such a subtle person."]],[2805,["What he said: “Thou shalt not have adulterous eyes.”"]],[2810,["How many Christians have you met without adulterous eyes?"]],[2822,["Subtleties of Christ, you can achieve it."]],[2827,["You can definitely achieve it through your self-realization."]],[2831,["The first thing He said and the last thing He said is"]],[2835,["“Know Thy Self.”"]],[2851,["You will enjoy your Christianity and Christ after Self-realization."]],[2857,["Now for example, you say that Christ was the Son of God."]],[2863,["But many will say, “How do you prove that?” It’s very simple in Sahaja Yoga."]],[2866,["You put your hands like this. After self-realization you ask a question:"]],[2871,["“Mother, was Christ the Son of God?” And see the vibrations, they start coming, cool breeze."]],[2877,["But ask about somebody horrible and you might get a little burning"]],[2882,["or you might get sometimes little blisters."]],[2889,["Because you were born in a religion, you follow it."]],[2893,["But then you follow Him, not blindly, but with an awakened mind."]],[2914,["Yogi: I also I want to inform you that generally,"]],[2919,["Shri Mataji agrees to grant a session of guided collective meditation"]],[2925,["at the end but by most of the people can feel this raising of the Kundalini,"]],[2931,["so, by all means, ask questions but of course (...)."]],[2944,["So the question now, Shri Mataji, was simply"]],[2946,["what is the role of vegetarianism?"]],[2949,["It is not so much emphasizing Your teachings,"]],[2951,["but it very much is emphasizing in other teachings."]],[2955,["Shri Mataji: You see, this is also an idea which has cropped up some time"]],[2959,["within the time of Shri Krishna. His cousin was an eminath who was a Jain gentleman."]],[2967,["And they used to all eat meat and everything,"]],[2971,["Krishna, Rama, everybody ate meat."]],[2973,["But what happened that his marriage was to be celebrated."]],[2977,["In the marriage, he saw all these things, so many goats and birds"]],[2985,["and all that and he felt a kind of a nausea about it."]],[2990,["So he didn’t marry and also he said \"let’s become vegetarians.\""]],[2996,["That’s how the vegetarianism started in India."]],[2999,["Now that has spread all over now."]],[3003,["And later on the vegetarianism has gone to such a limit among Jains"]],[3007,["that you have no idea, that you cannot kill bugs,"]],[3011,["you cannot kill (...), you cannot kill anything,"]],[3014,["because they are all living things. Apart from that, they get a brahmin,"]],[3020,["pay him a lot of money, put him in a hut"]],[3022,["and put all the bugs inside the hut"]],[3025,["and the bugs have to suck in the blood and when they are all satisfied,"]],[3031,["they pay money to the brahmin and go away."]],[3038,["It’s cruelty."]],[3041,["So what is the balancing point is this"]],[3044,["that whatever is required for the body should be eaten,"]],[3048,["but the animal which is bigger than you should not be eaten,"]],[3051,["because that animal’s muscle, as you know, muscle cells are"]],[3054,["bigger than your muscle cells and they might harm your teeth,"]],[3057,["they might harm your tongue. So if you save the chickens,"]],[3063,["am I going to give them realization?"]],[3067,["But those who have eaten too much non-veg food"]],[3070,["should take to vegetarianism is a good idea,"]],[3072,["but not that those who need"]],[3076,["non-veg food should not take it."]],[3079,["It’s not what you eat is so important,"]],[3082,["is all the funny ideas that have come."]],[3085,["It is what you get as the Spirit. Christ used to eat meat."]],[3091,["Mohammed Saheb used to eat meat, Nanaka used to eat meat, Kabira used to eat meat."]],[3096,["They were all bad people and those who are vegetarians,"]],[3099,["so-called, are the very nice people?"]],[3101,["In India, I must tell you, those who are strict vegetarians"]],[3105,["are one of the worst class, no doubt about it,"]],[3110,["because they are extremely cruel, extremely cruel people."]],[3117,["You can ask anyone who are the vegetarians"]],[3121,["and you’ll be surprised"]],[3123,["they are very money oriented, always run after money"]],[3128,["and they are just like, you can call them, [UNCLEAR Shiloh] type."]],[3135,["Very money-oriented people, extremely money-oriented."]],[3138,["But if you don’t like, you don’t eat. There is no force about it."]],[3142,["But somebody who eats because he needs it,"]],[3146,["is in no way comes in your spirituality, no way."]],[3152,["I may not eat but I don’t expect you not to eat."]],[3159,["It’s an individual question, it's an individual problem"]],[3162,["of a level that it’s not so much concern."]],[3169,["Also, like Rajneesh used to say, or Freud would say that"]],[3172,["sex plays a part in your spirituality is absolutely wrong."]],[3175,["It does not, because here you can see the seventh centre,"]],[3181,["which we call as the Mooladhara, which is looking after the pelvic plexus,"]],[3189,["which is responsible for all the excretion inclusive of sex, is below the Kundalini."]],[3199,["So when the Kundalini rises, all your excretion process stops."]],[3208,["That’s why Christ has said if you have to come to the kingdom of God,"]],[3214,["you have to become like small children, innocent."]],[3217,["And you do, because all these things stop"]],[3222,["when the ascent of the Kundalini takes place."]],[3274,["Yogi: No. I think there is a little misunderstanding."]],[3277,["Shri Mataji did not say to refrain sexuality."]],[3280,["Shri Mataji said sexuality has nothing to do with Kundalini awakening."]],[3283,["Shri Mataji: Yes. I better correct that. No, no, no, no."]],[3286,["Never I said that, I said that it does not play part"]],[3289,["in the ascent of the Kundalini. But sex, in a sane way, is important."]],[3296,["Absolutely important."]],[3299,["If somebody is not married or somebody calls himself a sanyasi,"]],[3303,["you tell him better change your ideas. The Kundalini doesn’t rise."]],[3312,["It’s a fact. The Kundalini tells you. She is the best judge."]],[3317,["That’s why while speaking to you I was a little hesitant."]],[3320,["There was one gentleman who hasn’t got realization as yet in London,"]],[3324,["only one who is not married, you see. I don’t know what to do with him."]],[3331,["I must confess, it’s true. I mean, what can I do about it."]],[3336,["I don’t mean it. I would love to do that"]],[3340,["but somehow he is not getting realization."]],[3344,["I think a sane marriage gives you a balance, a good family"]],[3348,["and is your responsibility to produce a good family, to produce good children."]],[3356,["Perhaps that is what is expected."]],[3360,["But I think there’s a misunderstanding because I said only that part."]],[3364,["I mean, at the time of realization."]],[3373,["No, if any such misunderstanding, you must ask me,"]],[3376,["because it’s a very short lecture and maybe some points are left out."]],[3380,["It’s better to ask, so there should no misunderstanding about things."]],[3393,["[Christ was not married, she said.]"]],[3395,["Yeah, He is different."]],[3400,["You crucified Him so fast. He could only preach for four years."]],[3405,["Christ was different, is very different."]],[3409,["You will understand His nature, what He was"]],[3415,["and then you will know why He did not need any marriage."]],[3432,["[She says, Christ said some are born eunuchs for the sake of the kingdom.]"]],[3441,["[It's written in the Bible some are born eunuchs for the sake of the kingdom,"]],[3448,["meaning some are not taken relationships.]"]],[3454,["That’s a little subtler. I think you’d better get your realization first"]],[3458,["and then you’ll know what it is. You see, also to read the Bible,"]],[3463,["not the Paul part because it’s only organizational."]],[3467,["You must get your self-realization. Even to read Gita,"]],[3470,["you must get your self-realization, otherwise you can become confused."]],[3483,["[Maybe we can have the questioning part later on at the end of the program?"]],[3487,["But should we, if people have other questions then I suggest"]],[3492,["that we can come down and [UNCLEAR]."]],[3497,["Shri Mataji this is what I would suggest if You be prepared, Shri Mataji,"]],[3505,["should we have the experience of collective meditation?"]],[3509,["Would you like it, would you like to have the experience?]"]],[3513,["Alright. As I told you, it cannot be forced."]],[3519,["A very simple thing is. It's a thing is that you have to ask for it."]],[3528,["It cannot be forced and it is vital that we should get it."]],[3536,["All of the vital things, we got spontaneously,"]],[3540,["without any trouble as human beings."]],[3543,["But this is another stage."]],[3549,["Say we have become human beings from amoeba or from, say, monkeys."]],[3557,["But now what we are going to become, we are going to be empowered,"]],[3563,["that we can transform people, that we can nourish the nature."]],[3574,["So because of this jump that we have to have in our awareness"]],[3580,["and in our strength, we have to understand what it is,"]],[3588,["because God has given us brains to understand."]],[3592,["Everything is logical, absolutely logical."]],[3599,["You can judge for yourself and see for yourself."]],[3606,["That is the reason why somebody has to tell you, decode it and tell you everything."]],[3612,["And then once you know it, you can also tell others."]],[3616,["It cannot be done in the way we have got this human awareness."]],[3621,["It’s a much higher awareness about which I am talking"]],[3626,["and for that, somebody has to tell you all the subtleties, all the decoding."]],[3632,["But that doesn’t mean that it is something obligatory for you."]],[3640,["I personally think it’s nothing for Me."]],[3642,["because whatever I have, I have, it’s nothing great."]],[3644,["I don’t think it’s something great to have something born with it."]],[3648,["But it’s definitely great for you to achieve it"]],[3653,["and that’s the thing I respect,"]],[3657,["that you have achieved all these powers yourself."]],[3661,["So there is no obligation at all, in no way."]],[3668,["So at the very outset,"]],[3672,["I have to tell you there are two conditions we have to have."]],[3676,["The first condition is that"]],[3680,["we have to forget the past and forgive ourselves,"]],[3686,["that not to feel guilty at all."]],[3692,["I mean, it’s something like a myth that we start feeling guilty."]],[3698,["As a result, we catch on this centre here."]],[3701,["The left side of the Vishuddhi, as we call it."]],[3703,["This centre when you catch, you can get spondylitis,"]],[3708,["you can get paralysis, you can get angina."]],[3716,["So it is useless to feel guilty."]],[3719,["After all, you are human beings, you are not gods."]],[3722,["If you have done mistakes, what’s there to feel guilty?"]],[3725,["Let the Kundalini find out. Why should we judge ourselves?"]],[3730,["That means you forget your past, forget your guilt and mistakes"]],[3735,["and everything and you have to be pleasantly placed toward yourself"]],[3739,["because now you are going to enter into the kingdom of God."]],[3743,["So you should be pleasantly placed toward yourself."]],[3749,["You have to respect, I would say you have to love yourself"]],[3752,["and know that you are a human being and have self-confidence"]],[3756,["that you are going to enter into the kingdom of God."]],[3760,["This is the first condition. The second one is that you have to forgive everyone."]],[3767,["The other day somebody said that to forgive others is very difficult."]],[3773,["Now whether you forgive or don’t forgive, you don’t do anything."]],[3777,["Again, logically, you don’t do anything. It’s just your idea that"]],[3781,["you don’t forgive,"]],[3784,["and if you don’t forgive, you play into the hands"]],[3787,["which are trying to harm you."]],[3792,["The people who are, the ones who tortured you are very happy"]],[3802,["while you are the one who is suffering because you cannot forgive."]],[3810,["So you have to forgive everyone. This is a very, very important, crucial point."]],[3818,["As I told you, in this cross here of the optic chiasma resides Christ"]],[3824,["and what He has told us, He has given us the greatest weapon is to forgive."]],[3830,["And if you don’t forgive, you cannot awaken Him,"]],[3834,["and if you cannot awaken Him, there are two functions:"]],[3838,["one is the Kundalini has to pass through and He sucks in"]],[3842,["our karmas and our conditionings from, you can see the two balloons there,"]],[3847,["to open up the limbic area for us, for the Kundalini to pass through."]],[3854,["So if you do not forgive, it’s going to be difficult for Me,"]],[3858,["because I cannot forgive for you."]],[3863,["So please, these two conditions, you have to fulfil."]],[3872,["I hope it’s not too much."]],[3874,["Now, we have to take the help of the Mother Earth,"]],[3878,["so if you could take out the shoes, it would be much better,"]],[3881,["just the shoes not the socks, but just the shoes."]],[3898,["Please, come in, there's lots of space here"]],[3901,["Yes, just come."]],[3912,["Modern Yoga is very wonderful, I think."]],[3914,["Sitting on the chair, you can get your realization."]],[3919,["You don’t have to do all kinds of asanas."]],[3926,["It has to be that way."]],[3934,["Now, pPlease remember, as I told you,"]],[3938,["this left side and right side there are two powers."]],[3940,["The left side power is the power of desire. Not of pure desire, but desire."]],[3945,["The right side is the power of action."]],[3948,["We have to keep both our feet a little away from each other."]],[3951,["We have to sit comfortably,"]],[3954,["not bending too much or putting yourself backwards too much,"]],[3959,["but just in a straight manner."]],[3964,["And put your left hand towards me like this."]],[3971,["This means that you want your self-realization,"]],[3975,["that you desire your self-realization."]],[3979,["Just like this, very comfortable,"]],[3981,["please put your left hand towards me like this,"]],[3985,["and with the right hand, we’ll be nourishing our centres."]],[3988,["So right hand, you have to put on your heart."]],[3992,["We work on your the left-hand side."]],[3996,["I’ll first show you and then we’ll close our eyes"]],[3999,["and we’ll work out the awakening of the Kundalini."]],[4006,["In the heart resides the Spirit."]],[4009,["So first we put the hand on the Spirit."]],[4014,["Then we put our hand on the upper portion of the abdomen on the left-hand side."]],[4021,["This is the centre of your mastery."]],[4025,["That means by awakening this centre, you get that power"]],[4032,["by which you can master the art of Kundalini awakening."]],[4038,["Then you take down your hand to the low portion of the abdomen and press it hard."]],[4044,["This is the centre of pure knowledge."]],[4049,["The pure knowledge is that knowledge that you get"]],[4052,["out of your evolutionary process which manifests on"]],[4057,["your nervous system, on you central nervous system."]],[4064,["Then again you have to raise your hand in the upper portion of your abdomen."]],[4076,["And then on your heart again."]],[4087,["Then raise your right hand in the corner of your neck here,"]],[4093,["neck and your shoulder and turn your head to your right."]],[4099,["This is the centre, which I told you just now,"]],[4102,["is completely disturbed when you feel guilty."]],[4106,["I think today with all of you it has this problem,"]],[4111,["so again I say please, please forgive yourself."]],[4117,["Then you have to take your right hand onto your forehead across like this"]],[4122,["and press it on both the sides."]],[4126,["Put down your head and press it nicely."]],[4128,["This is the centre for forgiving others."]],[4136,["Take back your right hand on the back side of your head"]],[4141,["and push back your head on it. Let it rest."]],[4147,["Here for your own satisfaction, without counting your mistakes,"]],[4151,["without feeling guilty, you have to ask forgiveness from the Divine Power"]],[4157,["which is All Pervading."]],[4160,["Now you have to stretch your hand fully"]],[4164,["and put the centre of your palm"]],[4167,["on top of the fontanelle bone area which was a soft bone in your childhood."]],[4176,["Please put it there exactly. Put down your head nicely,"]],[4180,["put down your head. Now, push back your fingers as much as you can,"]],[4184,["put down your head and push back your fingers."]],[4187,["Now push your hand on the scalp nicely, so it gives some pressure"]],[4193,["and now you have to move your scalp very slowly clockwise"]],[4198,["seven times."]],[4214,["Now this is all we have to do."]],[4218,["You can take out your spectacles also. It might help your eyesight,"]],[4221,["so please take out your spectacles."]],[4225,["Now again I repeat, you have to be pleasantly placed toward yourself."]],[4231,["Don’t feel guilty."]],[4234,["You have done nothing wrong in the eyes of the Divine."]],[4243,["Please now put your left hand towards me and right hand on your heart,"]],[4248,["both the feet apart and now close your eyes."]],[4263,["Here you have to ask a very fundamental question to me."]],[4270,["You may call me Shri Mataji or Mother, whatever you like."]],[4274,["“Mother, am I the Spirit?\" Ask this question three times,"]],[4278,["“Mother, am I the Spirit?\" Please ask this question three times in your heart."]],[4295,["Now if you are the Spirit, you are your master, you are your guide."]],[4302,["So take down your right hand the upper portion of the abdomen"]],[4306,["on the left-hand side, press it hard"]],[4309,["and here ask me another very fundamental question in your heart,"]],[4317,["“Mother, am I my own master? Mother, am I my own guru?”"]],[4322,["Ask this question three times."]],[4350,["As I’ve told you that I respect your freedom and I cannot force"]],[4358,["pure knowledge on you. You have to ask for it."]],[4363,["Now take down your right hand the lower portion of your abdomen,"]],[4367,["press it hard on the left-hand side and here you please say six times"]],[4372,["because this centre has got six petals."]],[4376,["“Mother, please give me pure knowledge.”"]],[4384,["This knowledge has to manifest on your central nervous system"]],[4389,["giving you a new dimension."]],[4398,["Ask earnestly."]],[4404,["As soon as you ask this question, the Kundalini starts rising."]],[4410,["So now we have to nourish the upper centers"]],[4413,["to open the passage for Kundalini rises."]],[4420,["So now you raise your right hand on the upper portion of your abdomen"]],[4427,["and pressed it hard on the left hand side."]],[4431,["Here now with full confidence, full confidance in youself,"]],[4436,["please say, \"Mother, I am my own master\", please say it,"]],[4442,["ten times, because this center has got ten petals."]],[4446,["Please say it with full confidence, \"Mother, I am my own master\"."]],[4473,["As I have told you the very beginning that"]],[4478,["the Truth is you are not this body and you are not this intellect,"]],[4486,["you are not these emotions and you are not these conditionings or this ego."]],[4494,["You are the pure Spirit."]],[4498,["So now please raise your right hand on your heart"]],[4501,["and say it again will full confidence twelve times,"]],[4508,["“Mother, I am the Spirit. Mother, I am the Spirit.”"]],[4513,["Please say it twelve times."]],[4544,["The Divine Power which is All-pervading"]],[4548,["is the Ocean of Knowledge and of Love."]],[4557,["It is the ocean of Benevolence and Blessings."]],[4565,["But above all, it is the Ocean of Forgiveness."]],[4571,["So whatever mistakes you might have committed,"]],[4576,["this Ocean of Forgiveness has the power to dissolve everything."]],[4582,["So please forgive yourself, forgive yourself,"]],[4587,["be pleasantly placed toward yourself"]],[4592,["and put your right in the corner of your neck and shoulder"]],[4597,["and turn your head to your right."]],[4602,["Here you have to say with full confidence,"]],[4606,["“Mother, I am not guilty at all.” Please say it sixteen times"]],[4611,["because this centre has got sixteen petals."]],[4614,["“Mother, I am not guilty at all.”"]],[4630,["I’ve already told you that whether you forgive or don’t forgive,"]],[4637,["you don’t do anything. But if you don’t forgive,"]],[4642,["then you play into wrong hands and suffer."]],[4648,["So now raise your right hand on top of your forehead"]],[4653,["and put down your head on your hand properly."]],[4656,["Press it on both the sides nicely and say it from your heart,"]],[4663,["“Mother, I forgive everyone.” I’m saying say it from your heart,"]],[4669,["not how many times, but say it from your heart."]],[4674,["“Mother, I forgive everyone.”"]],[4690,["Now take back your hand on the back side of your head"]],[4694,["and push back your head on that hand nicely, let it rest."]],[4699,["Here, please again remember, do not count your mistakes,"]],[4708,["do not feel guilty at all, but just for your satisfaction,"]],[4716,["you push back your head nicely, and say “Oh Divine Power,"]],[4722,["if I have done any mistakes knowingly or unknowingly,"]],[4726,["please forgive me.”"]],[4746,["Now, please stretch your hand, your palm fully."]],[4751,["Put the centre of your palm on top of the fontanel bone area"]],[4757,["which was the soft bone in your childhood."]],[4762,["Push back your fingers and press your scalp nicely."]],[4767,["Here, again, I cannot cross over your freedom."]],[4771,["You have to ask for your self-realization."]],[4774,["So now please put down your head, press it hard"]],[4778,["and move your scalp seven times very slowly with pressure."]],[4785,["Pushing back your fingers and here you have to say,"]],[4788,["“Mother, please give me my self-realization.”"]],[4794,["Put down your head nicely. “Mother, please give me my self-realization.”"]],[4800,["Seven times."]],[4843,["Please take down your hand and open your eyes."]],[4848,["Now, put both your hands towards me. Now try to think…"]],[4856,["Now watch me without thought. You can do it."]],[4860,["You can watch me without thought. This is the first state"]],[4863,["you achieve called as thoughtless awareness."]],[4868,["Now, put your right hand like this and right hand like this"]],[4875,["and left hand on top of your head, and put down your head"]],[4879,["and put your right hand and see for yourself, not on your head,"]],[4884,["but above your head, and see for yourself"]],[4887,["if there is a cool breeze coming out of your head."]],[4891,["Put down you head, please put your right hand like this."]],[4904,["Now please put your left hand towards me and put down your head"]],[4909,["and see for yourself if there is a cool breeze coming out of your head."]],[4918,["With the right hand, you can feel it. Now, don’t put it on top."]],[4922,["You have to put it above it, a little away."]],[4925,["Some people might get hot heat coming out, that’s all right,"]],[4929,["and some people might get it far away."]],[4932,["Doesn’t matter if there’s a heat coming out, it’s all right."]],[4934,["The heat has to come out."]],[4947,["Now, please put again the right hand. Bend your head again"]],[4950,["and see for yourself if there is a cool breeze coming out of your head."]],[4962,["Now , please raises both of your hands, like this."]],[4968,["Push back your head and ask a question three times, anyone of these,"]],[4973,["“Mother, is this the Cool Breeze of the Holy Ghost?.”"]],[4977,["“Mother, is this the Power of Love of God?”"]],[4985,["“Mother is this the All-Pervading Paramchaitanya.”"]],[4989,["Ask any one of these questions three times."]],[4996,["Now don’t doubt. Because there is air conditioning, you may doubt,"]],[5000,["but there is nothing to doubt about it."]],[5005,["Good."]],[5007,["Now take down your hands."]],[5013,["All those who’ve felt the cool breeze or the heat"]],[5017,["or the cool in their hands, out of their heads or on the hands,"]],[5025,["please raise both your hands. All those who have felt"]],[5029,["cool breeze out of your head or in your hands."]],[5034,["Is very good."]],[5037,["May God bless United Nations"]],[5042,["Most of you have felt it. Some have not, doesn’t matter."]],[5045,["It doesn’t mean there is something wrong with you."]],[5049,["But we have a club here, thank God, this is being (...)"]],[5056,["and you are all welcome. And we have great experts of Sahaja Yoga"]],[5060,["in New York, that’s one thing I must say,"]],[5063,["we have great experts of Sahaja Yoga"]],[5066,["and they will tell you each and everything about it, the whole knowledge."]],[5069,["You don’t have to pay for it. Only little bit of time, you have to give."]],[5073,["These days we have watches to save time,"]],[5076,["but we save time to waste it."]],[5079,["We have to save time to use it for our ascent"]],[5083,["and you don’t need much time for this."]],[5086,["About five minutes in the morning and ten minutes in the evening"]],[5088,["is more than sufficient, but you must first learn"]],[5091,["and you all must become great masters of Sahaja Yoga."]],[5095,["Next time when I come I hope I’ll be able to see"]],[5099,["lots of people who have got realization through you."]],[5103,["May God bless you all."]],[5117,["[May I ask one additional question regarding this self-realization?"]],[5122,["When people ask what do I do as a Sahaja Yogi,"]],[5126,["I had it explained what do we do,"]],[5133,["but they ask me what is this based on to make it work?]"]],[5143,["You see, it is actually is a state, is a state of our being."]],[5148,["An ones first state is of thoughtless awareness."]],[5151,["The second one is doubtless awareness. So you have to rise up to that"]],[5155,["and then you know everything yourself, I mean,"]],[5158,["it’s not much to explain because it becomes part and parcel of…"]],[5162,["Like I can see clearly this carpet, in the same way,"]],[5166,["I can clearly feel when I am a realized soul about everything."]],[5169,["So we have to rise up to that level, but not blindly."]]]);
